         mismatch validator, and disposable-fixture quarantine/reset. Engine-free (value objects +
         snapshot codec + the pure DerivedActivationView), link-compiled like the rest of Tracer 1. -->
    <Compile Include="../src/SBPR.Niflheim.HomesteadStones/Domain/Content/HomesteadProgressionCatalog.cs" />
    <Compile Include="../src/SBPR.Niflheim.HomesteadStones/Domain/Content/ContentRegistryValidator.cs" />
    <!-- Homestead progression Tracer 2 (T008): the authored Foundational construction-piece catalog
