    <!-- Homestead progression Tracer 2 (T007): recoverable Bond/Attunement/Release lifecycle.
         Pure relationship transitions + the receipt-backed cross-aggregate command handler and its
         authority/character projection sinks. Engine-free, link-compiled like the rest. -->
